**A) Highway driving** {#highway-driving}

As [speed](#speed "ontological:defines") (proxy for Ceff) rises, [Î©tempo increases](#omega-tempo "geometric:causes") quadratically (less reaction time, more interactions per Î”t). [Observability O falls](#observability "epistemic:measures") unless you [raise Rmax](#r-max "epistemic:supports") (ADAS sensors, laneâ€‘keeping, collision prediction). [Guardrails](#guardrails "symmetric:constrains"): speed limits, followingâ€‘distance rules, ramp meters.

